        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "82c0c783-c8f1-33f2-936c-a1fc6db995fc",
                "word": "brusquement",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d42d4f0c-ee46-3840-8140-d1cd6fbd2e19",
                        "entry_id": "82c0c783-c8f1-33f2-936c-a1fc6db995fc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "D’une manière brusque, inattendue ou soudaine."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "371e672b-b57b-4d75-9bfa-33dc15450ce6",
                                "sense_id": "d42d4f0c-ee46-3840-8140-d1cd6fbd2e19",
                                "text": "Nous en profitons pour bifurquer brusquement et nous arrivons enfin en zigzaguant à nous mettre hors de la portée de notre intrus."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "03e2df45-a321-4a0c-be3b-7c6c8824974e",
                                "sense_id": "d42d4f0c-ee46-3840-8140-d1cd6fbd2e19",
                                "text": "Il agit donc sur la tirette, le rideau se releva brusquement, et alors, à la stupéfaction générale, on vit saint Jean-Baptiste, en pyjama bleu de ciel, […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dcddf69d-92c0-49fa-84af-f82f920fa0b6",
                                "sense_id": "d42d4f0c-ee46-3840-8140-d1cd6fbd2e19",
                                "text": "Comme ils franchissaient le seuil, des formes invisibles surgirent, brusquement, de l'ombre. C'était les slouguis qui se précipitaient, menaçants. Mᵐᵉ Durelle poussa un cri."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8a453ece-0e37-4a9b-93cc-dd79ef22cd65",
                                "sense_id": "d42d4f0c-ee46-3840-8140-d1cd6fbd2e19",
                                "text": "La vie, après de longs mois d'hivernage, avait été arrêtée brusquement par l'arrivée de navire de la délivrance."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1507e152-8e90-46d8-9477-4064bd2c1d70",
                                "sense_id": "d42d4f0c-ee46-3840-8140-d1cd6fbd2e19",
                                "text": "Cette assimilation au statut « d’homme », ce nivellement, cette rapidité de communication profonde avec les gens de notre âge, cet univers quotidien brusquement peuplé de gens de quarante ans finissent par être si évident à Berthoux qu’il hyper-simplifie et se met à inclure dans sa quarantaine tout individu qui recoupe son orbite."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "767a5186-9e23-45ca-8c8b-2cd6239469f0",
                        "source_entry_id": "82c0c783-c8f1-33f2-936c-a1fc6db995fc",
                        "source_sense_id": "d42d4f0c-ee46-3840-8140-d1cd6fbd2e19",
                        "target_lang_word": "plötzlich",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "plötzlich",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d89b399e-d1dd-34f4-bdba-e39a3db5e87e",
                                        "entry_id": "c73bb506-ab8d-352d-bea5-febb8093ff05",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "unerwartet, überraschend, auf einen Schlag"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fe462d18-3e11-4cea-a2fa-3e86ec9a388d",
                                                "sense_id": "d89b399e-d1dd-34f4-bdba-e39a3db5e87e",
                                                "text": "„Plötzlich hörte der Motorflieger auf zu kreisen. In eine ganz andere Richtung ging es auf einmal.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "58ce6522-464f-4631-bc76-66fa3aa3b039",
                                                "sense_id": "d89b399e-d1dd-34f4-bdba-e39a3db5e87e",
                                                "text": "Plötzlich kam ein alter Mann in den Laden."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "77ac4a65-d7bc-4919-9c01-d2f09eb7f8b9",
                                                "sense_id": "d89b399e-d1dd-34f4-bdba-e39a3db5e87e",
                                                "text": "Was soll denn dieser plötzliche Aufbruch?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "46522f9e-ef96-4047-a682-d1a8c0fd3d90",
                                                "sense_id": "d89b399e-d1dd-34f4-bdba-e39a3db5e87e",
                                                "text": "Mein Vater ist ganz plötzlich gestorben."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "91a330df-bb50-473d-a752-beed10e2de7f",
                                                "sense_id": "d89b399e-d1dd-34f4-bdba-e39a3db5e87e",
                                                "text": "„Eine plötzliche Vertragskündigung durch Yahoo beendete laut dem Verein die Geschäftsbeziehung.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b2202c98-8f8b-42ca-8d57-a0381957382a",
                        "source_entry_id": "82c0c783-c8f1-33f2-936c-a1fc6db995fc",
                        "source_sense_id": "d42d4f0c-ee46-3840-8140-d1cd6fbd2e19",
                        "target_lang_word": "suddenly",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "suddenly",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "381904d2-a0fa-3869-80f8-713229bcd1f1",
                                        "entry_id": "b4602e66-3e9c-3a64-b1ba-c57b0f38c649",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Happening quickly and with little or no warning; in a sudden manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8e6e4ae1-a56b-4ffc-ad0e-daf126075dae",
                                                "sense_id": "381904d2-a0fa-3869-80f8-713229bcd1f1",
                                                "text": "Suddenly, the heavens opened and we all got drenched."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4b0aeef6-4f88-446a-9597-009ef96f1f4e",
                                                "sense_id": "381904d2-a0fa-3869-80f8-713229bcd1f1",
                                                "text": "They've suddenly decided to sell the house."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3063b5d4-74b7-4262-8a9e-66623a1457a3",
                                                "sense_id": "381904d2-a0fa-3869-80f8-713229bcd1f1",
                                                "text": "The king before he would take his voyage, sent the Erle of Huntyngdon to ſerche and ſcowre the Seas, leaſt any Frenchmen lyeng in wayte for him might attrap him sodeinly, or he had any knowledge of their ſetting forward."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f0e96555-43e8-4e9d-bdbf-8a130168d0d6",
                                                "sense_id": "381904d2-a0fa-3869-80f8-713229bcd1f1",
                                                "text": "But ever since the concept of \"hamartia\" recurred through Aristotle's Poetics, in an attempt to describe man's ingrained iniquity, our impulse has been to identify a telling defect in those brought suddenly and dramatically low."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "03572a14-7bba-45cf-8a6e-d6c062d0eafa",
                        "source_entry_id": "82c0c783-c8f1-33f2-936c-a1fc6db995fc",
                        "source_sense_id": "d42d4f0c-ee46-3840-8140-d1cd6fbd2e19",
                        "target_lang_word": "갑자기",
                        "target_lang_code": "ko",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
